WEBVTT

00:00:01.935 --> 00:00:05.735
Hajimari no kaze yo

00:00:06.172 --> 00:00:10.006
Todoke Message

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:19.341
'Itsudemo anata wo Shinjiteirukara'

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:20.620
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:28.661
The Story of Saiunkoku
Ano toki yume ni miteita
Sekai ni tatteirunoni

00:00:28.661 --> 00:00:28.990
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:29.195 --> 00:00:36.397
Miwatasu keshiki ni
Ashi wo sukoshi sukumase

00:00:36.770 --> 00:00:40.900
Dakedo ushiro furimukanaide

00:00:41.007 --> 00:00:45.000
Aruiteyuku koto
Kimeta kara

00:00:45.311 --> 00:00:49.407
Miageta sora
Nana iro no niji

00:00:49.582 --> 00:00:52.983
Anata mo mitemasuka?

00:00:53.319 --> 00:00:57.312
Hajimari no kaze yo

00:00:57.624 --> 00:01:01.458
Todoke Message

00:01:01.861 --> 00:01:09.961
Yumeni kakedashita senaka
Mimamoru kara

00:01:10.403 --> 00:01:14.339
Maiagaru kaze yo

00:01:14.741 --> 00:01:18.541
Hi no hikari matoi

00:01:19.012 --> 00:01:28.444
Jiyuu no tsubasa de
Tsuyoku tobitatou

00:01:31.724 --> 00:01:33.885
Seiran, Ensei, Eigetsu...

00:01:34.594 --> 00:01:37.392
...as well as Korin, who is
acting as a stand-in for Shurei...

00:01:37.831 --> 00:01:39.662
...have been captured by Sojun Sa.

00:01:39.732 --> 00:01:42.667
His grandfather, Chusho Sa,
seeks the Sa Clan leadership.

00:01:43.336 --> 00:01:45.395
They're being held in the
town of Sairi...

00:01:45.939 --> 00:01:50.137
...the border checkpoint
to enter Sa Province.

00:02:02.155 --> 00:02:03.315
Mr. Kokujun!

00:02:03.456 --> 00:02:04.718
Do you know him?

00:02:05.658 --> 00:02:09.116
He's Mr. Sojun's younger brother,
the third son of the Sa family.

00:02:17.537 --> 00:02:19.505
It's been a while, Miss Korin.

00:02:22.041 --> 00:02:24.009
This isn't good. He knows.

00:02:24.978 --> 00:02:29.938
Bolt Out of the Blue

00:02:31.518 --> 00:02:33.486
Shurei is the only one who
escaped danger.

00:02:33.653 --> 00:02:34.620
Using Korin's name...

00:02:34.687 --> 00:02:39.386
...she is traveling with a merchant
by the name of Senya Rin.

00:02:40.326 --> 00:02:43.818
It's already been six days since
we entered Sa Province and Sairi.

00:02:44.964 --> 00:02:46.989
I wonder if everyone's all right.

00:02:48.434 --> 00:02:50.902
No matter what happens,
you're to get to Kinka.

00:02:51.404 --> 00:02:56.899
Just when is our prodigal young master
planning to depart for Kinka, anyway?

00:03:01.047 --> 00:03:03.515
Good morning, mast...

00:03:05.552 --> 00:03:07.520
Good morning, Korin.

00:03:08.721 --> 00:03:11.155
Master! Would you please put on
some proper clothing?!

00:03:12.926 --> 00:03:15.394
You're awake unusually
early today, aren't you?

00:03:15.762 --> 00:03:17.923
It's too hot to sleep.

00:03:18.198 --> 00:03:20.666
At times like this, you've got
to sleep out of sheer will.

00:03:21.267 --> 00:03:24.566
I'm afraid those words
are not in my vocabulary.

00:03:24.971 --> 00:03:27.030
You simply have no will, do you?

00:03:28.441 --> 00:03:31.672
I've prepared some ice and
fruit, and I brought your fan.

00:03:32.612 --> 00:03:34.580
No, I'd rather have you play your erhu.

00:03:35.048 --> 00:03:38.040
Please play something that will
make me at least feel cooler.

00:03:38.751 --> 00:03:40.810
I'm surprised you're not
tired of my music by now...

00:03:40.887 --> 00:03:42.684
...after having me play
until late every night.

00:03:42.755 --> 00:03:47.124
No one's playing has ever
pleased me as much as yours.

00:03:48.061 --> 00:03:49.494
Whatever.

00:03:49.562 --> 00:03:53.293
But more importantly, when are
you going to depart for Kinka?

00:03:55.235 --> 00:03:57.203
It should be any time now.

00:03:57.570 --> 00:03:59.538
Any time now?

00:04:00.340 --> 00:04:02.205
Now, play.

00:04:17.490 --> 00:04:19.481
You look rather troubled.

00:04:22.328 --> 00:04:23.317
Advisor So.

00:04:23.396 --> 00:04:26.763
Isn't there anyone within the Sa Clan
as talented as Advisor Sa?

00:04:27.333 --> 00:04:29.563
Why are you asking me
something like that now?

00:04:30.570 --> 00:04:33.038
Advisor Sho said that he would go
all the way to Sa Province himself...

00:04:33.106 --> 00:04:34.630
...so it got me thinking.

00:04:34.707 --> 00:04:37.676
He went to return the Sa clan
leader's ring, didn't he?

00:04:38.211 --> 00:04:40.304
You knew that Advisor Sho
had the ring?!

00:04:43.850 --> 00:04:47.616
And as for the Sa Clan, around
fourteen or fifteen years ago...

00:04:47.687 --> 00:04:50.656
...Advisor Sa, Enjun, returned home
to take care of some business.

00:04:51.991 --> 00:04:54.516
When he returned from Sa Province...

00:04:55.862 --> 00:04:57.227
...he said something about...

00:04:57.997 --> 00:05:00.124
...the possibility of a monster
within the Sa Clan.

00:05:01.501 --> 00:05:02.900
A monster?

00:05:02.969 --> 00:05:05.597
That was the only time he ever
spoke of it, but nine years ago...

00:05:05.805 --> 00:05:10.105
...during the civil war when Enjun's
son and daughter-in-law were killed...

00:05:10.677 --> 00:05:12.770
...those words came back to me.

00:05:14.614 --> 00:05:16.582
Sure, Enjun was here in Shi Province.

00:05:16.983 --> 00:05:18.951
But how did the one responsible...

00:05:19.018 --> 00:05:21.316
...for killing his son and son's
wife slip past Eiki?

00:05:22.488 --> 00:05:24.217
You mean Advisor Sa's lady?

00:05:24.891 --> 00:05:25.550
Yes.

00:05:25.758 --> 00:05:29.285
Eiki is a daughter of the Hyo Clan, a
clan that possesses unusual abilities.

00:05:29.662 --> 00:05:31.630
And she has the ability
to see the future.

00:05:32.832 --> 00:05:36.529
Pulling off something like killing the
son and his wife with Eiki so close...

00:05:36.969 --> 00:05:39.233
...was something that no one in
the Sa Clan could possibly do.

00:05:39.706 --> 00:05:42.470
So they figured there had to be
a monster among the Sa Clan.

00:05:43.443 --> 00:05:45.411
We don't know if there is one or not.

00:05:45.745 --> 00:05:49.704
However, if there is, that person must
be regarded as extremely dangerous.

00:05:51.050 --> 00:05:53.018
A monster.

00:06:03.329 --> 00:06:07.060
You really are very good. Where
did you learn to play like that?

00:06:08.067 --> 00:06:10.968
From my mother.
She excelled at the erhu.

00:06:11.971 --> 00:06:16.305
Still, while you did put
on something like I asked...

00:06:17.210 --> 00:06:19.610
...you've done nothing more than
drape something around you.

00:06:19.779 --> 00:06:22.646
Likewise, you haven't worn that
cute outfit I had set out for you.

00:06:23.349 --> 00:06:26.182
Master. I'm not a princess.

00:06:26.786 --> 00:06:29.152
What need is there for me
to wear an outfit like that?

00:06:29.222 --> 00:06:31.122
Because it would be
food for the eyes.

00:06:31.190 --> 00:06:33.715
Just admit that you're doing
it to spite me.

00:06:34.227 --> 00:06:38.926
What an odd thing to say. You have
plenty of potential to be beautiful.

00:06:39.232 --> 00:06:40.494
Wha...?!

00:06:40.566 --> 00:06:43.034
Although the word cute
suits you better right now.

00:06:54.647 --> 00:06:57.115
Today, you're here not only
to feed us, I'm guessing.

00:06:57.650 --> 00:07:01.609
It's been seven days. Miss Korin
appears to be feeling a lot better.

00:07:02.889 --> 00:07:04.754
You're sure about this, Kokujun?

00:07:06.025 --> 00:07:09.017
You were waiting for Miss Korin to
regain her strength, weren't you?

00:07:09.929 --> 00:07:12.295
After all, knowing you, you
could've escaped at any time.

00:07:12.765 --> 00:07:13.925
Well, yeah.

00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:17.663
But if I can get away without having
to waste energy, then all the better.

00:07:18.905 --> 00:07:20.099
Hey, Seiran...

00:07:20.206 --> 00:07:23.471
...we'd better go and get that sword
His Majesty entrusted you with.

00:07:23.776 --> 00:07:27.303
After all, it wouldn't be at all amusing
if it ended up getting sold, would it?

00:07:27.980 --> 00:07:31.677
Not to worry.
That sword is quite fancy.

00:07:33.019 --> 00:07:34.987
It's not likely to get sold that easily.

00:07:35.855 --> 00:07:38.085
Besides, this sword isn't all
that bad either.

00:07:38.558 --> 00:07:40.753
In that case,
shall we make a run for it?

00:07:41.260 --> 00:07:44.821
A-Are you saying you have no
intention of saving the governors?

00:07:45.231 --> 00:07:47.529
Did Eigetsu say, "save me"?

00:07:48.034 --> 00:07:49.092
N-No.

00:07:49.202 --> 00:07:52.228
He only asked me to tell you Miss
Korin's condition and nothing else.

00:07:52.839 --> 00:07:55.808
- In that case, they should be fine.
- But they've been captured!

00:07:56.042 --> 00:07:59.671
If they've already been captured,
there's no risk of being captured again.

00:08:00.046 --> 00:08:01.741
That's why they'll be fine.

00:08:01.814 --> 00:08:03.782
There's something wrong
with that logic.

00:08:04.217 --> 00:08:06.685
I figured that as long as I let
you out of the dungeon, then...!

00:08:06.819 --> 00:08:09.014
Then everything would turn out well?

00:08:10.957 --> 00:08:15.189
You assumed that I'd save
Eigetsu, Miss Korin, and Shunki?

00:08:18.030 --> 00:08:19.622
Life's not that easy, Kokujun.

00:08:19.699 --> 00:08:22.532
You act like you're doing something,
but in fact you're doing nothing.

00:08:22.602 --> 00:08:28.598
Just hoping that someone stronger
will take care of things.

00:08:29.308 --> 00:08:33.404
Shunki is a lot braver than you are.

00:08:35.581 --> 00:08:37.481
Shunki.

00:08:38.017 --> 00:08:41.384
Instead of worrying about Shunki, why
not do something about it yourself?

00:08:42.455 --> 00:08:43.922
How do you mean?

00:08:43.990 --> 00:08:46.117
Even though they're
younger, Eigetsu and Korin...

00:08:46.192 --> 00:08:48.490
...have prepared themselves
much better than you have.

00:08:48.561 --> 00:08:52.691
Those two are still alive, because
they're not afraid to go to the brink...

00:08:53.332 --> 00:08:56.768
...walking a tightrope while
using their wits to the limit.

00:08:59.805 --> 00:09:02.603
What I'm saying is, before hoping
for someone to come to the rescue...

00:09:02.675 --> 00:09:04.540
...try making a difference yourself.

00:09:05.378 --> 00:09:06.868
Hey, Kokujun.

00:09:06.946 --> 00:09:08.504
I commend your bravery...

00:09:08.581 --> 00:09:10.913
...in not only bringing food and
water for seven days...

00:09:11.350 --> 00:09:13.250
...but now you've even
unlocked the door for us...

00:09:13.319 --> 00:09:16.288
...even though you are the
third son of the Sa Clan.

00:09:18.024 --> 00:09:19.992
If your elder brother Sojun finds out...

00:09:20.059 --> 00:09:22.857
...you could find yourself in
great danger. You did well.

00:09:23.729 --> 00:09:25.697
No one's telling you to risk your life.

00:09:25.998 --> 00:09:28.660
However, there's a difference between
what's absolutely impossible...

00:09:28.734 --> 00:09:31.703
...and giving up on things that are
possible right from the outset.

00:09:34.774 --> 00:09:36.742
See you later.

00:09:44.817 --> 00:09:46.614
You really can be officious.

00:09:46.686 --> 00:09:48.654
Not only do you tell him to
take action...

00:09:49.055 --> 00:09:51.523
...you give him a lecture and give
him a little push at the end.

00:09:51.824 --> 00:09:55.316
If something comes outta giving him
a push, then all the better, right?

00:09:57.496 --> 00:09:59.464
Can he really make a difference?

00:09:59.599 --> 00:10:01.567
There they are! It's them!

00:10:01.767 --> 00:10:03.735
Don't let them get away!

00:10:04.136 --> 00:10:05.433
Now, don't move!

00:10:05.504 --> 00:10:08.405
Let's clean things up here quickly and
join up with Princess and the others.

00:10:08.808 --> 00:10:10.571
Don't injure the officials.

00:10:10.910 --> 00:10:11.501
Right.

00:10:21.587 --> 00:10:23.680
Everyone. Be safe.

00:10:25.891 --> 00:10:28.416
Damn it! That Ensei Ro!

00:10:29.161 --> 00:10:31.152
He really did escape!

00:10:32.331 --> 00:10:35.095
Are you two really the governors?

00:10:35.635 --> 00:10:39.002
Why would Ensei leave you guys
behind and make a run for it?

00:10:39.438 --> 00:10:42.930
That's because we're the
real ones, right?

00:10:43.275 --> 00:10:44.674
What?!

00:10:44.744 --> 00:10:50.182
If we're the real governors, then
you people can't kill us. That's why.

00:10:50.916 --> 00:10:52.543
Get real!

00:10:55.187 --> 00:10:58.156
The only one we can't kill is the girl,
because she's from the Hong Clan.

00:10:58.424 --> 00:11:01.882
Make no mistake. We're only keeping
you alive for the hell of it, that's it.

00:11:02.528 --> 00:11:05.656
I can kill you whenever I want! Like now!

00:11:06.298 --> 00:11:08.266
Stop it!

00:11:14.006 --> 00:11:18.966
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:11:19.945 --> 00:11:22.004
If you doubt us, then
go ahead and kill him.

00:11:22.081 --> 00:11:24.413
However, be sure you're
prepared for the consequences.

00:11:24.950 --> 00:11:26.144
What?

00:11:26.218 --> 00:11:29.847
If you kill Governor To, then I
will kill myself shortly after.

00:11:30.389 --> 00:11:33.449
If I die, the Hong Clan
will move immediately.

00:11:34.326 --> 00:11:38.023
If both of us lose our lives on your
lands, whose fault will it be seen as?

00:11:39.098 --> 00:11:41.464
And when you see the extent of
the revenge against the Sa Clan...

00:11:41.534 --> 00:11:44.833
...you'll regret it so much not even death
itself will free you from your conscience!

00:11:46.372 --> 00:11:49.500
If you are prepared to go
through that, go ahead! Kill him!

00:11:50.943 --> 00:11:57.280
Also, didn't that man who was with
you say that Mr. Ensei would escape?

00:11:57.850 --> 00:11:59.044
That man?

00:11:59.185 --> 00:12:00.083
Escape?!

00:12:00.186 --> 00:12:02.620
Oh he will.
Don't ever doubt it.

00:12:03.622 --> 00:12:05.249
Meisho.

00:12:07.226 --> 00:12:07.920
Damn it!

00:12:09.295 --> 00:12:13.129
Yeah, I'm supposed to take these
two to Kinka after Ensei escapes.

00:12:13.833 --> 00:12:17.826
Damn! I wanna smash that
guy's head into pieces!

00:12:18.537 --> 00:12:23.565
In that case, how about if I
take those two to Kinka, Sojun?

00:12:24.143 --> 00:12:26.111
Kokujun. You will?

00:12:26.512 --> 00:12:27.706
But since falling under
Shunki's influence...

00:12:27.780 --> 00:12:29.247
...you've spouted nothing but stupidity.

00:12:29.715 --> 00:12:33.446
I want the chance to restore my honor
as the third son of the Sa Clan.

00:12:35.187 --> 00:12:37.985
And in the meantime, that idiot
Sakujun hasn't come out of Kinka yet.

00:12:38.290 --> 00:12:41.589
Well, I guess even you are capable
of babysitting a couple of kids.

00:12:42.895 --> 00:12:46.592
Fine then, Kokujun. Try and get
them to Kinka as soon as you can.

00:12:51.337 --> 00:12:53.305
Mr. Kokujun.

00:12:54.874 --> 00:12:57.866
Thank you very much for releasing
Mr. Ensei and Mr. Seiran.

00:12:58.410 --> 00:13:01.106
What is it with you?! You're so
small, yet always so reckless!

00:13:01.380 --> 00:13:05.373
You know, I'm a lot tougher
than I appear. I feel fine.

00:13:05.951 --> 00:13:08.943
No matter how tough you may be, if you
get stabbed by a spear, you'll still die!

00:13:09.755 --> 00:13:14.124
Those two are still alive, because
they're not afraid to go to the brink...

00:13:14.593 --> 00:13:18.085
...walking a tightrope while
using their wits to the limit.

00:13:21.200 --> 00:13:22.497
Mr. Kokujun.

00:13:22.568 --> 00:13:25.696
We'll be together for the next while,
so I'm hoping we'll get along.

00:13:27.006 --> 00:13:29.474
In any case, we can finally
relax a little now.

00:13:29.742 --> 00:13:33.473
Are you okay with this? I'm
Sojun's younger brother, you know.

00:13:34.747 --> 00:13:38.945
You knew that Korin was a fake,
yet you didn't tell anyone.

00:13:40.186 --> 00:13:44.179
I'm not strong. I might even
end up betraying you later.

00:13:44.857 --> 00:13:47.655
So be it. You have to deal
with your own circumstances.

00:13:48.460 --> 00:13:51.395
Whatever happens, we will
still do what we ought to do.

00:13:52.464 --> 00:13:55.433
It'll take at least a month to go
from Sairi to Kinka.

00:13:55.501 --> 00:13:57.401
Please get ready for the journey.

00:13:58.404 --> 00:13:59.871
Yes!

00:14:07.279 --> 00:14:09.247
It's been seven days now since
we entered Sairi.

00:14:09.315 --> 00:14:10.976
Just when are we going to leave?

00:14:18.724 --> 00:14:20.885
You look much nicer with
your hair down.

00:14:21.393 --> 00:14:24.521
Or rather, I wish you'd leave it
down because I like it that way.

00:14:24.930 --> 00:14:26.420
Please give me back my hairpin!

00:14:26.498 --> 00:14:29.058
I have absolutely no intention of
leaving my hair down in this heat.

00:14:36.041 --> 00:14:38.009
Honestly, Master!

00:14:39.445 --> 00:14:41.470
Will you do my hair as well?

00:14:41.981 --> 00:14:44.040
But you just simply tie it
back, don't you?

00:14:44.750 --> 00:14:46.718
But it's pretty difficult.

00:14:48.854 --> 00:14:50.822
I'll do it for you.

00:14:52.358 --> 00:14:54.826
You may very well have inherited the
merchant business from your family...

00:14:54.960 --> 00:14:57.793
...but that business will end with
you if you keep on like this.

00:14:58.497 --> 00:15:00.829
You certainly speak bluntly,
don't you? Why?

00:15:00.900 --> 00:15:04.961
What's most important for a
merchant is to do things promptly.

00:15:05.504 --> 00:15:07.472
Yet, you don't, Master.

00:15:08.407 --> 00:15:11.376
All right. We'll leave today.

00:15:12.244 --> 00:15:16.305
We'll depart around noon.
Do things promptly, right?

00:15:17.149 --> 00:15:19.083
Well, yes, but...!

00:15:19.151 --> 00:15:21.847
Besides, things could become
quite unpleasant around here.

00:15:22.321 --> 00:15:23.618
Unpleasant?

00:15:23.689 --> 00:15:26.157
It seems there's been an
escape from the border prison.

00:15:27.893 --> 00:15:30.361
They say that the escapees
are an extremely strong pair.

00:15:30.596 --> 00:15:32.564
That certainly does
sound unpleasant.

00:15:32.898 --> 00:15:33.887
It's rather frightening, isn't it?

00:15:34.700 --> 00:15:35.632
Indeed.

00:15:35.935 --> 00:15:38.460
Not to mention Sa Province has been
on edge lately over the new governors.

00:15:38.537 --> 00:15:40.835
On top of that, bandits have
been on a rampage lately.

00:15:41.507 --> 00:15:43.270
Add to that the matter of this escape.

00:15:46.011 --> 00:15:50.744
It's all right. I'll see you safely
to Kinka, so you can rest easy.

00:15:51.817 --> 00:15:56.151
After all, I really took to you
from the moment I first saw you.

00:15:59.258 --> 00:16:02.159
Would it be all right for me
to go out for a moment, Master?

00:16:08.801 --> 00:16:10.769
Hey, welcome.

00:16:10.936 --> 00:16:13.598
I'd like all the Gan Lu
tea you have in your shop.

00:16:14.606 --> 00:16:15.573
A-All?!

00:16:16.041 --> 00:16:17.065
Yes.

00:16:17.276 --> 00:16:19.870
Payment should be sought from
my prodigal young master...

00:16:20.346 --> 00:16:22.280
...Senya Rin, by noon today.

00:16:22.614 --> 00:16:25.242
Ah, o-one moment, please!

00:16:27.686 --> 00:16:29.654
I can finally move forward!

00:16:30.255 --> 00:16:35.625
Seiran. Ensei. Eigetsu. Korin.
We'll meet in Kinka! For sure!

00:16:41.066 --> 00:16:45.696
Twenty days and a bit later, Shurei
found herself in a small town.

00:16:46.405 --> 00:16:48.635
This time they appeared
in the town of Rosen.

00:16:48.874 --> 00:16:50.842
That mysterious bounty-hunting duo.

00:16:51.243 --> 00:16:53.234
Word is that those two are capturing
Murderous Blades members...

00:16:53.312 --> 00:16:55.280
...one after another, and
earning quite the bounty.

00:16:55.347 --> 00:16:57.713
Not to mention, one of them
sure is handsome, isn't he?

00:16:58.751 --> 00:17:01.151
The other one doesn't
even look human, does he?

00:17:01.220 --> 00:17:04.189
I hear he's some kind of
part-man, part-bear monster.

00:17:05.958 --> 00:17:09.155
They're really something.
Earning travel money as they go.

00:17:09.995 --> 00:17:13.624
Also, the fact that Eigetsu
and Korin aren't with them...

00:17:14.266 --> 00:17:16.234
...means that those two are safe.

00:17:16.301 --> 00:17:19.065
If they weren't, Seiran and
Ensei would've rescued them.

00:17:24.943 --> 00:17:27.377
This sketch is really harsh.

00:17:28.180 --> 00:17:31.047
I'm a pretty good-looking guy
if I shave my beard, you know.

00:17:31.884 --> 00:17:35.320
But Princess has been leaving us
clear signs of her whereabouts.

00:17:35.554 --> 00:17:37.522
She's really something, isn't she?

00:17:38.090 --> 00:17:39.990
We're all out of Gan Lu tea.

00:17:40.059 --> 00:17:43.256
A young lady very skilled
with the erhu bought it all.

00:17:44.196 --> 00:17:47.393
All we need to do is go to
any tea merchants...

00:17:47.766 --> 00:17:49.791
...and ask if they have Gan Lu tea
and we get news about her.

00:17:50.235 --> 00:17:51.793
We don't attract attention
to ourselves.

00:17:51.870 --> 00:17:54.338
Also, it's much safer and remains more
vividly in the shopkeepers' minds...

00:17:54.406 --> 00:17:57.933
...than recklessly leaving
a message or note behind.

00:17:58.744 --> 00:18:00.712
Talk about brilliant.

00:18:01.480 --> 00:18:03.539
That much is a given for Her Ladyship.

00:18:04.483 --> 00:18:08.385
Still, it's really impressive,
for the frugal Princess.

00:18:08.787 --> 00:18:12.348
To squander money like
that for our sake.

00:18:12.791 --> 00:18:15.157
We really are loved, aren't we?

00:18:21.200 --> 00:18:23.168
Murderous Blades!

00:18:28.941 --> 00:18:31.239
Sa Province is Yushun's
and my territory.

00:18:31.844 --> 00:18:33.812
So you're the Murderous Blades?
Are you stupid?

00:18:33.879 --> 00:18:36.439
You guys have some nerve coming
out like you did while I was away.

00:18:36.882 --> 00:18:38.850
You'll regret this!

00:18:56.101 --> 00:18:57.568
Korin.

00:18:57.636 --> 00:18:59.433
Oh, no! Master!

00:19:00.139 --> 00:19:02.107
What do you mean, "oh, no"?

00:19:02.207 --> 00:19:06.974
I've never before received such a
response when speaking to a lady.

00:19:08.614 --> 00:19:10.548
You surprised me greatly, so...!

00:19:10.849 --> 00:19:14.478
I came to keep an eye on you so that
you don't purchase any more tea, but...!

00:19:14.920 --> 00:19:17.912
Oh, if so, you're a little late.

00:19:18.624 --> 00:19:20.285
So it appears.

00:19:20.893 --> 00:19:23.953
You keep buying all the Gan Lu tea
everywhere we go. What will you do?

00:19:24.930 --> 00:19:26.124
Do you intend to open a teahouse?

00:19:26.365 --> 00:19:27.559
No.

00:19:27.799 --> 00:19:30.996
Later, I'm gonna make lots of tea for
the people who are important to me.

00:19:33.238 --> 00:19:35.502
So you have people
important to you, then.

00:19:36.175 --> 00:19:38.143
Yes, I do.

00:19:40.179 --> 00:19:42.147
That makes me jealous.

00:19:42.781 --> 00:19:44.043
Rosen?

00:19:44.950 --> 00:19:48.181
It seems they've passed us.
Those mysterious bounty hunters.

00:19:48.787 --> 00:19:49.981
Ah, you're right.

00:19:50.556 --> 00:19:53.184
The Murderous Blades and the
mysterious bounty hunters...

00:19:53.926 --> 00:19:56.827
...are both heading in the same
direction we are.

00:19:56.895 --> 00:19:58.760
It's as if they're chasing us.

00:19:59.031 --> 00:20:00.760
Y-You think so?

00:20:01.500 --> 00:20:03.468
It must be nice to be so carefree.

00:20:04.236 --> 00:20:07.569
But let's take our time
and go casually, shall we?

00:20:08.373 --> 00:20:10.773
It'll be at least another ten
days before we arrive at Kinka.

00:20:12.277 --> 00:20:15.610
What you do isn't called taking
your time, it's called laziness.

00:20:16.181 --> 00:20:18.240
I see. You have a way with words.

00:20:21.453 --> 00:20:22.545
Hey.

00:20:22.621 --> 00:20:24.179
No woman has ever come to
understand me...

00:20:24.256 --> 00:20:26.588
...so well in such a short time.

00:20:27.259 --> 00:20:30.285
I think there's nothing left
but for the two of us to marry.

00:20:31.230 --> 00:20:33.562
Y-You know, Master.

00:20:34.166 --> 00:20:36.396
I wish you'd stop calling
me Master, already.

00:20:38.237 --> 00:20:42.298
Rather than the young master of the
Rin family, I want you to see me.

00:20:44.409 --> 00:20:46.877
Rather than the king,
I want you to see me.

00:20:48.347 --> 00:20:50.110
This man...!

00:20:50.182 --> 00:20:55.848
Senya... I wish you'd say my name
with that cute voice of yours.

00:21:00.392 --> 00:21:04.488
I-I like calling you Master.

00:21:04.963 --> 00:21:07.659
Also, I wish you wouldn't
joke about getting married.

00:21:09.134 --> 00:21:11.068
I think we'd make a good couple.

00:21:11.603 --> 00:21:13.764
Please think about the difference
in our ages before saying that!

00:21:13.839 --> 00:21:15.807
Really? Age, you say.

00:21:16.808 --> 00:21:17.775
Come to think of it...

00:21:17.843 --> 00:21:21.540
...the ages of the couple in the
upcoming marriage are similar.

00:21:22.014 --> 00:21:23.914
The marriage between the incoming
governor and the son of the Sa family.

00:21:23.982 --> 00:21:27.918
I-Is that so. The new governor
and the Sa main house's...!

00:21:29.855 --> 00:21:31.322
What?!

00:21:33.058 --> 00:21:38.690
That would be me, right?
Wh-What's this about marriage?

00:21:41.800 --> 00:21:44.132
By the way, that was
quite the rumor in town.

00:21:44.836 --> 00:21:45.996
What rumor?

00:21:46.071 --> 00:21:48.562
Princess' marriage to the
second son of the Sa Clan.

00:21:49.341 --> 00:21:52.208
You seem surprised, like
a bolt out of the blue.

00:21:53.312 --> 00:21:55.644
But that's a pretty
high road, isn't it?

00:21:55.714 --> 00:21:57.875
Trying to make her
theirs through marriage.

00:21:58.483 --> 00:22:01.646
The eldest is Sojun and
Kokujun's the third son...

00:22:01.953 --> 00:22:03.284
...so the second son
would be Sakujun.

00:22:03.355 --> 00:22:07.291
He's around 29, so he's
just a little older than us...

00:22:07.759 --> 00:22:10.250
...and there's a twelve year
difference between him and Princess.

00:22:10.362 --> 00:22:12.330
Any way you look at it,
there's no way that marriage proposal...

00:22:12.397 --> 00:22:13.329
...would ever be accepted.

00:22:14.032 --> 00:22:17.331
Even if there was a remote chance
it was accepted, that Sakujun guy...

00:22:17.602 --> 00:22:20.036
...would be killed by the assassins
Reishin sends after him.

00:22:20.706 --> 00:22:22.674
He'd be a goner in an instant.

00:22:23.408 --> 00:22:26.206
The scary thing is, that's not a joke.

00:22:27.979 --> 00:22:30.846
Princess and Eigetsu
will make good governors.

00:22:31.750 --> 00:22:34.048
I'm looking forward to the
day I get to work with them.

00:22:34.619 --> 00:22:35.483
Yeah.

00:22:36.355 --> 00:22:38.323
Not to mention you'll be around, too.

00:22:42.594 --> 00:22:44.289
I'm afraid...

00:22:45.497 --> 00:22:48.159
...you'll have to give up
on that day ever coming.

00:22:51.002 --> 00:22:52.970
Meisho!

00:22:53.872 --> 00:22:55.271
So, the leader of the
Murderous Blades...

00:22:55.340 --> 00:22:57.069
...is making a personal
appearance, I see.

00:22:58.443 --> 00:23:02.937
It's been fourteen years, Little
Whirlwind, Little Rascal King.

00:23:30.509 --> 00:23:35.606
Itsumo sugoku jiyu na anata ha ima

00:23:35.814 --> 00:23:42.151
Kono ame no naka donna
Yume wo oikaketeiruno

00:23:42.454 --> 00:23:47.414
Dokokade kodoku to tatakainagara

00:23:47.626 --> 00:23:52.723
Namida mo gaman shiterundarou

00:23:53.732 --> 00:23:58.135
Hitori demo daijobu to

00:23:59.671 --> 00:24:04.802
Anata mo watashi to onaji

00:24:05.577 --> 00:24:16.146
Tomawari bakari dakedo
Nazeka kono michi ga suki de

00:24:17.022 --> 00:24:22.619
Shiawase da toka ureshii toki ha

00:24:23.028 --> 00:24:28.091
Anata no koto wo omoidasu kara

00:24:28.967 --> 00:24:34.530
Iroazayaka na kisetsu ha kitto

00:24:34.906 --> 00:24:41.709
Kono omoi todoketekureru

00:24:45.050 --> 00:24:45.317
Next Episode

